```

In the internals of hono it falls back to the EventV1Processor but even here it can not extract a valid HTTP Method since event.httpMethod is not defined on the event.
```js
var EventV1Processor = class extends EventProcessor {
 ...
  getMethod(event) {
    return event.httpMethod;
  }
...
}
```

A simple fix could be:
```js
var EventV1Processor = class extends EventProcessor {
 ...
  getMethod(event) {
    return event.httpMethod || 'POST';
  }
...
}
```

Is there a way to override the EventProcessor which will be used?

